      "body": "### 🟡 Changes recommended\n\nThere are correctness/robustness issues in the new TLS wrapper logic (exception type propagation and default-factory wrapping behavior) plus a test package/path mismatch that should be addressed before merging.\n\n*Once you've addressed the issues Copilot identified, you can request another Copilot review.*\n\n<details>\n<summary>Pull request overview</summary>\n\nThis PR updates `RESTMusicService` TLS handling by introducing a socket-factory wrapper that filters out legacy SSL/TLS protocol names on created `SSLSocket` instances, and adds an Android instrumentation test validating the filtering behavior.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Wraps `HttpsURLConnection`’s default `SSLSocketFactory` and the service’s insecure socket factory with a legacy-protocol filtering `SSLSocketFactory`.\n- Adds `filterLegacyTlsProtocols(String[])` and supporting logic to remove SSL*/TLSv1.0/TLSv1.1 while retaining TLSv1.2+ and unknown future TLS versions.\n- Adds an androidTest verifying legacy-protocol removal and fail-closed behavior when nothing acceptable remains.\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>File summaries</summary>\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| app/src/main/java/github/paroj/dsub2000/service/RESTMusicService.java | Adds legacy TLS protocol filtering via a delegating `SSLSocketFactory` and a testable filter seam. |\r\n| app/src/androidTest/java/github/paroj/dsub2000/ApplicationTest.java | Adds instrumentation coverage for the new protocol-filtering seam. |\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Review details</summary>\n\n- **Files reviewed:** 2/2 changed files\n- **Comments generated:** 4\n- **Review effort level:** Lite\n</details>\n\n---\n\n💡 <a href=\"/paroj/DSub2000/new/edge?filename=.github/skills/code-review/SKILL.md\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Add a `code-review` agent skill</a> or configure MCP servers for context-aware, tailored reviews. <a href=\"https://docs.github.com/copilot/how-tos/use-copilot-agents/request-a-code-review/use-code-review?tool=webui#mcp-servers-and-agent-skills\" class=\"Link--inTextBlock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn more in the docs.</a>",
